/P 64 0 R
/E (Monitoring the health condition of multiple patients is an important task in hospitals. However, manually observing and recording vital signs can be time-consuming, especially when several patients need to be monitored simultaneously. It may also become difficult to identify abnormal changes quickly and maintain an organized record of each patient's health status.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
