/P 64 0 R
/E (To address these challenges, the project aims to develop a Java based desktop application that simulates continuous monitoring of multiple patients. The system generates vital readings, analyzes them against predefined threshold values and generates alerts whenever abnormal readings are detected.The application also provides a graphical interface to manage patient details, view live readings, track alerts and generate reports. The system can simulate the monitoring of multiple patients simultaneously while maintaining a responsive interface.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
