/E (Healthcare environments require regular monitoring of patients to keep track of their health conditions and identify possible abnormalities. Vital signs such as heart rate, oxygen saturation blood pressure and body temperature provide important information about a patient's physical condition.With the advancement of technology, monitoring systems have become useful for organizing health related information and presenting it in an easily accessible format. Such systems can simulate the collection of patient readings, analyze the values using predefined conditions and highlight abnormal readings through alerts.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
